    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的呆火驼它\n变成超级大冰坨了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845446706B9A7C5B83000A53D862108D857EA7592751B057684E86FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们才进入野生特区……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC624D8FDB516591CE751F7279533A2026202600100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就被卷入了野生宝可梦们的争斗里，\n它一下子挨了10发冰冻光束！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3188AB537751654E8691CE751F5B9D53EF68A64EEC76844E89659791CCFF0C000A5B834E004E0B5B5063284E860031003053D151B051BB5149675FFF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "明明是火属性的呆火驼，\n却被冻成了硬邦邦的大冰坨！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "660E660E662F706B5C5E602776845446706B9A7CFF0C000A537488AB51BB62104E86786C90A690A67684592751B05768FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "连解冻药也没效果的话，\n就只能用炙热的火属性招式把冰融化了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FDE89E351BB836F4E5F6CA16548679C76848BDDFF0C000A5C3153EA80FD7528709970ED7684706B5C5E602762DB5F0F628A51B0878D53164E86FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就拜托你了！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用炙热滚烫的火属性招式\n把冻住呆火驼的冰融化吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C3162DC62584F604E86FF0100100001BE01000A7528709970ED6EDA70EB7684706B5C5E602762DB5F0F000A628A51BB4F4F5446706B9A7C768451B0878D53165427FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像喷射火焰那么热的火属性招式\n一定可以把冰融化的！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就算呆火驼是火属性，\n但这样下去也是会感冒的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF55B75C04706B713090A34E4870ED7684706B5C5E602762DB5F0F000A4E005B9A53EF4EE5628A51B0878D53167684FF0100100001BE01000A5C317B975446706B9A7C662F706B5C5E6027FF0C000A4F468FD968374E0B53BB4E5F662F4F1A611F51927684300200100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还不够！用更热的\n火属性招式把冰融化吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD84E0D591FFF01752866F470ED7684000A706B5C5E602762DB5F0F628A51B0878D53165427300200100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太棒了！冰全都融化了！\n真是太感谢你啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A68D24E86FF0151B0516890FD878D53164E86FF01000A771F662F592A611F8C224F605566FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呆火驼，你还好吗！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
